- Signatures unverified (missing packager key; no keyserver fetch was performed).
- The consumer test used trivial /tmp fixtures and the lane working copy as of this run; the candidate
  is still in flux, so the tool's sha256 is recorded above. The full fault grid was not run.
- The 2.44.0 consumer path was tested only at the argv level (identical refusal message), not end-to-end.
- No fault fixture was run against real lane or fleet repos.

